msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本发布"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Version Release"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本提供了一个稳定的代码基础快照，封装成可以通过 PyPI 轻松安装的二进制包。此外，版本发布代表着开发团队可以向社区正式宣布新功能的可用性、已完成的改进以及可能影响用户的变化（例如破坏性变更）。"
msgstr "A Triton-Ascend version provides a snapshot of a stable code base, packaged as a binary package that you can easily install through PyPI. In addition, a version release means the development team can formally announce the availability of new features, completed improvements, and changes that may affect users (for example, breaking changes) to the community."

msgid "发布计划"
msgstr "Release Plan"

msgid "以下是 Triton-Ascend 的发布计划。请注意：补丁版本是可选的。"
msgstr "The following is the release plan for Triton-Ascend. Note that patch versions are optional."

